{
 "ablation": "A4",
 "chunks": [
  {
   "char_end": 120,
   "char_start": 0,
   "chunk_id": "webnlg_0000#c000",
   "doc_id": "webnlg_0000",
   "idx": 0,
   "text": "Nie Haisheng was a fighter pilot from the People's Republic of China who was born in Hubei, Zaoyang on October 13, 1964."
  },
  {
   "char_end": 183,
   "char_start": 0,
   "chunk_id": "webnlg_0001#c000",
   "doc_id": "webnlg_0001",
   "idx": 0,
   "text": "The Enaire operated Adolfo Suarez Madrid-Barajas Airport is based in Paracuellos de Jarama. It has a runway length of 3500 metres and is at an elevation of 610 metres above sea level."
  },
  {
   "char_end": 155,
   "char_start": 0,
   "chunk_id": "webnlg_0002#c000",
   "doc_id": "webnlg_0002",
   "idx": 0,
   "text": "In the United States, where Abraham A, Ribicoff was born, African Americans are one of the ethnic groups. Abraham A. Ribicoff was married to Ruth Ribicoff."
  },
  {
   "char_end": 92,
   "char_start": 0,
   "chunk_id": "webnlg_0003#c000",
   "doc_id": "webnlg_0003",
   "idx": 0,
   "text": "The timezone of Ciudad Ayala which is led by Juan Nolasco is the Pacific Standard Time Zone."
  },
  {
   "char_end": 107,
   "char_start": 0,
   "chunk_id": "webnlg_0004#c000",
   "doc_id": "webnlg_0004",
   "idx": 0,
   "text": "The length of the ALCO RS-3 is 17068.8 millimetres. It has a diesel-electric transmission and a V12 engine."
  },
  {
   "char_end": 138,
   "char_start": 0,
   "chunk_id": "webnlg_0005#c000",
   "doc_id": "webnlg_0005",
   "idx": 0,
   "text": "The Bedford Aerodrome (located in Thurleigh) serves the Bedford Autodrome. The ICAO location identifier for the Bedford Aerodrome is EGBF."
  },
  {
   "char_end": 117,
   "char_start": 0,
   "chunk_id": "webnlg_0006#c000",
   "doc_id": "webnlg_0006",
   "idx": 0,
   "text": "Liselotte Grschebina was born in Karlsruhe and died in Israel, which has the ethic group, Arabs and the Israeli Jews."
  },
  {
   "char_end": 277,
   "char_start": 0,
   "chunk_id": "webnlg_0007#c000",
   "doc_id": "webnlg_0007",
   "idx": 0,
   "text": "The campus address for the Acharya Institute of Technology is: Soldevanahalli, Acharya Dr. Sarvapalli Radhakrishnan Road, Hessarghatta Main Road, Bangalore - 560090, India and it is affiliated with the Visvesvaraya Technological University. It was established in the year 2000."
  },
  {
   "char_end": 127,
   "char_start": 0,
   "chunk_id": "webnlg_0008#c000",
   "doc_id": "webnlg_0008",
   "idx": 0,
   "text": "Alan B. Miller Hall, owned by the College of William and Mary, was designed by Robert A.M. Stern and completed on June 1, 2009."
  },
  {
   "char_end": 120,
   "char_start": 0,
   "chunk_id": "webnlg_0009#c000",
   "doc_id": "webnlg_0009",
   "idx": 0,
   "text": "Liselotte Grschebina was born in Karlsruhe and died in Israel. The Arab citizens of Israel is an ethnic group in Israel."
  }
 ],
